      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, this isn\u0027t related with AICS, but it is a VCP mute report, and for VCP it seems correct as per vcs spec:\n\n```\n2.3.1.2 Mute field\nThe Mute field has two values: Not Muted (or the numeral “0”), and Muted (or the numeral “1”)....\n```\n\nWhich is not the same as the AICS mute field. (yep confusing ....)\n\nFYI In the next CL I am simply removing AICS from this file to prevent confusion and un-necessary serialization (aosp/3323436, aosp/3323774, aosp/3323775, aosp/3323776, aosp/3323777)",
